			(property "Description" "Thorlabs FGA01FC InGaAs photodiode, TO-46(mod) can in an FC/PC bulkhead. 1.003 A/W at 1550nm, Cj 2.0pF at 5V, 20V max reverse, 18mW damage threshold, 0.12mm active area. Panel-mounted: only the three leads land on the board (footprint Optical:PD_TO46_FGA01FC_3pin). Reverse-bias the cathode; the anode sources photocurrent into the TIA summing node. Pinout 1=K (cathode), 2=CASE, 3=A (anode) - CONFIRMED against the datasheet drawing (Rev F, 24112-S01); the datasheet text carries no pin table, the mapping is only in the Drawing page schematic."
				(at 0 0 0)
